            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Draftava 1.4.6

- Draftava now remembers the last opened draft when you quit and relaunch.
- Each project remembers its own last selected draft.
- If that draft is no longer available, Draftava opens another available draft.
]]></description>
